WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.040
[THE USE OF CASH
IS DECLINING IN EUROPE]

00:00:04.480 --> 00:00:07.480
[THE DIGITAL EURO
IS THE RESPONSE TO THIS CHANGE]

00:00:07.480 --> 00:00:09.920
[IT IS JUST LIKE THE PHYSICAL EURO]

00:00:09.920 --> 00:00:12.960
[BUT IN DIGITAL FORM]

00:00:13.840 --> 00:00:17.120
[ALLOWING PAYMENTS
ACROSS THE ENTIRE EURO AREA]

00:00:18.600 --> 00:00:20.560
[EVEN WITHOUT INTERNET CONNECTION]

00:00:21.080 --> 00:00:24.360
[WHY IS IT NECESSARY?]

00:00:24.720 --> 00:00:28.388
[A FEW GLOBAL COMPANIES
PROCESS 2/3 OF PAYMENTS]

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:33.160
[THE DIGITAL EURO WOULD OFFER
MORE CHOICE AT A LOWER COST]

00:00:33.360 --> 00:00:37.880
[PAYMENTS PROTECTED
BY EUROPEAN PRIVACY LAWS]

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:42.240
[INFRASTRUCTURE
WITHSTANDING CYBER-ATTACKS]

00:00:42.800 --> 00:00:44.600
[OR POWER CUTS]

00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:50.600
[NO RESTRICTIONS ON WHERE,
WHEN, OR WHOM TO PAY]

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:53.920
[THE DIGITAL EURO]

00:00:54.160 --> 00:00:58.480
[CASH OR DIGITAL,
A EURO WILL ALWAYS BE A EURO]

